NEW: Thread instance created, start() not yet invoked.

RUNNABLE: Ready to execute and waiting for CPU allocation from the OS Thread Scheduler.

RUNNING: Executing instructions inside its run() method.

BLOCKED: Waiting to acquire an intrinsic object lock held by another thread.

WAITING: Waiting indefinitely for another thread to perform an action (via wait(), join(), or LockSupport.park()).

TIMED_WAITING: Waiting for a specified time period (via sleep(ms), wait(ms), join(ms)).

TERMINATED: Execution completed or unhandled exception thrown.



